@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam maxMessageSize 80
hide footbox
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant "c:RideEditCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant "m:Model" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant ":Storage" as Storage STORAGE_COLOR

[-> Logic : execute(commandText)
activate Logic
note over Logic, Command : Parsing succeeds and produces c (calls omitted).
Logic -> Command : getOverlapWarning(m)
activate Command
note right of Command : Validate proposal; check roster conflicts.\nNo mutation or save.
Command --> Logic : warning or empty string
deactivate Command
opt overlapping time change
    [<-- Logic : warning
    deactivate Logic
    ... User reviews and confirms ...
    [-> Logic : execute(confirmation)
    activate Logic
    note over Logic : Consume pending request; reject stale book.
end
Logic -> Command : execute(m)
activate Command
note right of Command : Revalidate and build replacement.\nPreserve ID, roster and omitted fields.
Command -> Model : setRide(target, replacement)
Command --> Logic : result
deactivate Command
Logic -> Model : getAddressBook()
Model --> Logic : book
Logic -> Storage : saveAddressBook(book)
Storage --> Logic
[<-- Logic : result
deactivate Logic

legend bottom
  Successful path; validation details and cancellation are described in prose.
  A saving error is reported after replacement, without rollback.
endlegend
@enduml
